(6294630, 931893, 124982, '<td valign="top">I understand what you were trying to do with the 3rd glass containing air...but feel like the reversed orientation of the glass disturbs the flow of the picture. Right side up and this would''ve had much more impact.<br/> <br/>A really nice take on the challenge nonetheless!</td>', 'I understand what you were trying to do with the 3rd glass containing air...but feel like the reversed orientation of the glass disturbs the flow of the picture. Right side up and this would''ve had much more impact. A really nice take on the challenge nonetheless!', '2011-01-26 07:46:33.000000', NULL, 1),
