(6294732, 931828, 124982, '<td valign="top">Really like the ice on this picture...the structure and texture are so interesting! Unfortunately looks a little underexposed, so some of the detail is lost? White balance also seems a little off?</td>', 'Really like the ice on this picture...the structure and texture are so interesting! Unfortunately looks a little underexposed, so some of the detail is lost? White balance also seems a little off?', '2011-01-26 09:29:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(6294736, 931513, 124982, '<td valign="top">WOW!! The colors on this are phenomenal...makes me wish I was there to see this myself! Absolutely stunning! Great big fat 8!</td>', 'WOW!! The colors on this are phenomenal...makes me wish I was there to see this myself! Absolutely stunning! Great big fat 8!', '2011-01-26 09:33:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(6294737, 931391, 124982, '<td valign="top">The reds in this picture are killer! Especially the glossy color on the kids'' wrap. But I think it is very nicely balanced with the muted tones of the carpet and the boys skin, giving it a nice even feel. Outstanding -- top 3 in my list with a score of 8!</td>', 'The reds in this picture are killer! Especially the glossy color on the kids'' wrap. But I think it is very nicely balanced with the muted tones of the carpet and the boys skin, giving it a nice even feel. Outstanding -- top 3 in my list with a score of 8!', '2011-01-26 09:33:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(6294738, 930959, 124982, '<td valign="top">There were multiple entries with this same idea, but you absolutely nailed it. Top 3 for me with a well-deserved 8. Just gorgeous! <br/> <br/>(Ps..wonder if a tighter crop on the right hand side would''ve focused the attention more to the glass and their elements? I find my eye is allowed to roam in the empty space to the right)</td>', 'There were multiple entries with this same idea, but you absolutely nailed it. Top 3 for me with a well-deserved 8. Just gorgeous!  (Ps..wonder if a tighter crop on the right hand side would''ve focused the attention more to the glass and their elements? I find my eye is allowed to roam in the empty space to the right)', '2011-01-26 09:33:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(6294739, 931923, 124982, '<td valign="top">Very simplistic and minimalist interpretation of the challenge. It''s a good thing..certainly sets it apart from all the landscape pictures. Well done!</td>', 'Very simplistic and minimalist interpretation of the challenge. It''s a good thing..certainly sets it apart from all the landscape pictures. Well done!', '2011-01-26 09:34:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(6294740, 930979, 124982, '<td valign="top">Really nicely done! Just LOVE the flames in the glass (wonder if the glass broke or shattered?). One nitpick is that with the exposure as is, the earth component is a black mass (at least on my monitor), and cant really tell what it is? Some small lighting to give it color/contrast/texture would''ve blown this out of the park! Wonderful photo as is, and a 7.</td>', 'Really nicely done! Just LOVE the flames in the glass (wonder if the glass broke or shattered?). One nitpick is that with the exposure as is, the earth component is a black mass (at least on my monitor), and cant really tell what it is? Some small lighting to give it color/contrast/texture would''ve blown this out of the park! Wonderful photo as is, and a 7.', '2011-01-26 09:34:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(6294743, 931389, 124982, '<td valign="top">Such a serene picture, captured at the perfect time of day. Beautifully done, and a great alternative interpretation to the challenge! Top 5!</td>', 'Such a serene picture, captured at the perfect time of day. Beautifully done, and a great alternative interpretation to the challenge! Top 5!', '2011-01-26 09:46:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(6294745, 931977, 124982, '<td valign="top">Beautiful colors and a lovely composition! Seems a little over-processed for my liking though (re: pixelated look of the waves in the foreground)</td>', 'Beautiful colors and a lovely composition! Seems a little over-processed for my liking though (re: pixelated look of the waves in the foreground)', '2011-01-26 09:49:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(6294747, 931979, 124982, '<td valign="top">Such a great take on the challenge! Love the idea of the different color lights for each element!<br/> <br/>I wonder whether it would''ve looked better (or worse?) if you went more minimalist and only had one representative item for each element in each of the compartments?</td>', 'Such a great take on the challenge! Love the idea of the different color lights for each element! I wonder whether it would''ve looked better (or worse?) if you went more minimalist and only had one representative item for each element in each of the compartments?', '2011-01-26 09:51:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(6294748, 931440, 124982, '<td valign="top">Such a lovely photo...wish I was there to see this sunrise!</td>', 'Such a lovely photo...wish I was there to see this sunrise!', '2011-01-26 09:52:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(6294749, 931127, 124982, '<td valign="top">The vignette really stands out as a great element in this photo - helps reinforce the closing in darkness with the setting sun!</td>', 'The vignette really stands out as a great element in this photo - helps reinforce the closing in darkness with the setting sun!', '2011-01-26 09:53:43.000000', NULL, 1),
