(6294780, 931165, 96751, '<td valign="top">The metallic tones really accentuate the rhythms in this image.  I especially like the area where the water and fire meet.</td>', 'The metallic tones really accentuate the rhythms in this image.  I especially like the area where the water and fire meet.', '2011-01-26 10:23:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(6294786, 931831, 96751, '<td valign="top">Fabulous image and magnificent lighting.  With all the elements present subtly but clearly.  Incredible lighting, and the droplets are icing on the cake.  Only halfway through voting, but this is in ribbon territory.</td>', 'Fabulous image and magnificent lighting.  With all the elements present subtly but clearly.  Incredible lighting, and the droplets are icing on the cake.  Only halfway through voting, but this is in ribbon territory.', '2011-01-26 10:38:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(6294788, 930959, 96751, '<td valign="top">Beautiful and classy.  Superb lighting.  I''m sure it was intentional, but I can''t decide about the drops of water next to the vase.</td>', 'Beautiful and classy.  Superb lighting.  I''m sure it was intentional, but I can''t decide about the drops of water next to the vase.', '2011-01-26 10:40:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(6294792, 930979, 96751, '<td valign="top">What are the odds that a similar image came just before you.  Likewise, beautifully conceived and executed.  The base of the stems and their reflection for some reason make me think of chicken feet.  Once I saw them that way, I just can''t seem to unsee it.  Has no effect on the score, just thought it was funny.</td>', 'What are the odds that a similar image came just before you.  Likewise, beautifully conceived and executed.  The base of the stems and their reflection for some reason make me think of chicken feet.  Once I saw them that way, I just can''t seem to unsee it.  Has no effect on the score, just thought it was funny.', '2011-01-26 10:42:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(6294793, 931871, 96751, '<td valign="top">Shoehorn for me, but I love from the air images, and forgive you for wanting to post it somewhere.</td>', 'Shoehorn for me, but I love from the air images, and forgive you for wanting to post it somewhere.', '2011-01-26 10:42:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(6294794, 931929, 96751, '<td valign="top">Green flames...?  Interesting editing choice, but a wonderful abstract image, nonetheless.  Strong diagonal lines, and superb textures.</td>', 'Green flames...?  Interesting editing choice, but a wonderful abstract image, nonetheless.  Strong diagonal lines, and superb textures.', '2011-01-26 10:43:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(6294796, 931213, 96751, '<td valign="top">An excellent concept, nicely framed and composed.  But your white balance is very off, and it needs some levels/contrast tweaking;  this needs some editing love.</td>', 'An excellent concept, nicely framed and composed.  But your white balance is very off, and it needs some levels/contrast tweaking;  this needs some editing love.', '2011-01-26 10:45:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(6294797, 931418, 96751, '<td valign="top">Those just might be the world''s largest matches...</td>', 'Those just might be the world''s largest matches...', '2011-01-26 10:45:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(6294798, 931964, 96751, '<td valign="top">Buddha went spelunking and found light in the heart of the earth</td>', 'Buddha went spelunking and found light in the heart of the earth', '2011-01-26 10:46:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(6294799, 931843, 96751, '<td valign="top">I love it when people bring beach chairs to watch the sunset.  Gorgeous rays.</td>', 'I love it when people bring beach chairs to watch the sunset.  Gorgeous rays.', '2011-01-26 10:46:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(6294805, 931391, 96751, '<td valign="top">Such a wonderful portrait.  Great lighting, subject, composition.  I may have selectively shifted the color on the box of objects to make the red just a bit different from the rest (so it would stand out more).  And with so much attention to detail, the floor covering is not at the level of the rest of the image.  It might have helped if the reflective board the box extended all the way to the bottom edge, or not to be used at all.  Likewise, the carpet he''s sitting on should either have filled the space behind him , or been more clearly an intentional (to make it more of a magical/ceremonial piece).  As it is, it draws attention to itself for no reason, and isn''t all that attractive.<br/> <br/>All the above to be taken with a grain of salt as personal taste.</td>', 'Such a wonderful portrait.  Great lighting, subject, composition.  I may have selectively shifted the color on the box of objects to make the red just a bit different from the rest (so it would stand out more).  And with so much attention to detail, the floor covering is not at the level of the rest of the image.  It might have helped if the reflective board the box extended all the way to the bottom edge, or not to be used at all.  Likewise, the carpet he''s sitting on should either have filled the space behind him , or been more clearly an intentional (to make it more of a magical/ceremonial piece).  As it is, it draws attention to itself for no reason, and isn''t all that attractive. All the above to be taken with a grain of salt as personal taste.', '2011-01-26 10:52:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(6294808, 931893, 96751, '<td valign="top">Slightly different from two other images using this approach.  This has the most dynamic layout, and the inverted glass is a clever choice (to trap the air :-)<br/> <br/>I also like the edgeless bg, and the terrific, oblique lighting.  But there is something a bit off on the color - the whole image seems a bit dull, lacking some sort of crispness and zing.</td>', 'Slightly different from two other images using this approach.  This has the most dynamic layout, and the inverted glass is a clever choice (to trap the air :-) I also like the edgeless bg, and the terrific, oblique lighting.  But there is something a bit off on the color - the whole image seems a bit dull, lacking some sort of crispness and zing.', '2011-01-26 10:54:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(6294809, 931986, 96751, '<td valign="top">I LOVE your concept of air.  I wonder how the image would look if it had been created with colors that weren''t identical to those of the earth.</td>', 'I LOVE your concept of air.  I wonder how the image would look if it had been created with colors that weren''t identical to those of the earth.', '2011-01-26 10:55:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(6294810, 931923, 96751, '<td valign="top">Nice, although a bit dark overall.</td>', 'Nice, although a bit dark overall.', '2011-01-26 10:56:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(6294811, 931895, 96751, '<td valign="top">Ooooh, I smell controversy....  Beautiful image.  I love the treatment, the concept, the dof and blur.  But it''s essentially a picture of a picture, I''m afraid.</td>', 'Ooooh, I smell controversy....  Beautiful image.  I love the treatment, the concept, the dof and blur.  But it''s essentially a picture of a picture, I''m afraid.', '2011-01-26 10:57:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(6294813, 931721, 96751, '<td valign="top">SPLENDID reflection.  Not sure a square crop was the way to go for this.</td>', 'SPLENDID reflection.  Not sure a square crop was the way to go for this.', '2011-01-26 10:58:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(6294814, 931828, 96751, '<td valign="top">What a great optical illusion.  Either that''s the world''s largest bonfire, or the world''s tiniest ice cliff.  Beautiful.</td>', 'What a great optical illusion.  Either that''s the world''s largest bonfire, or the world''s tiniest ice cliff.  Beautiful.', '2011-01-26 10:59:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(6294815, 931389, 96751, '<td valign="top">Stunning.  The lighting and colors are exquisite.  Front page for sure.</td>', 'Stunning.  The lighting and colors are exquisite.  Front page for sure.', '2011-01-26 11:03:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(6294817, 931967, 96751, '<td valign="top">I usually don''t have a problem with blown out highlights, but in this case, it''s just a bit too overpowering.  The rest of the scene doesn''t stand a chance.</td>', 'I usually don''t have a problem with blown out highlights, but in this case, it''s just a bit too overpowering.  The rest of the scene doesn''t stand a chance.', '2011-01-26 11:03:47.000000', NULL, 1),
