(6294968, 931979, 83350, '<td valign="top">I am not sure what everyone else will think or vote, but this is the most original composition in the bunch, I can see it getting slammed, but I give it a 10. Hope people will notice the subtle light changes in the shelves - no matter where u end up, this was great thinking on your part!!</td>', 'I am not sure what everyone else will think or vote, but this is the most original composition in the bunch, I can see it getting slammed, but I give it a 10. Hope people will notice the subtle light changes in the shelves - no matter where u end up, this was great thinking on your part!!', '2011-01-26 13:16:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(6294977, 931466, 119417, '<td valign="top">I like the texture in the clouds and the color in the water. I think I''d prefer if the boats were either fully in silhouette or were more brightly exposed to bring out the detail.</td>', 'I like the texture in the clouds and the color in the water. I think I''d prefer if the boats were either fully in silhouette or were more brightly exposed to bring out the detail.', '2011-01-26 13:23:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(6294988, 931893, 119417, '<td valign="top">Not bad. I like the way the background is lit, though it would be nice if the "earth" glass were a little brighter. Still, the highlights are controlled nicely. The angled positioning is a nice touch, but I feel like the spacing is just a tad off--the right three seem more tightly grouped than the left one. Finally, I think that it would be good if the red candle popped a little more--the rest of the image is very close to monochrome, so the one use of color should make more of a splash.</td>', 'Not bad. I like the way the background is lit, though it would be nice if the "earth" glass were a little brighter. Still, the highlights are controlled nicely. The angled positioning is a nice touch, but I feel like the spacing is just a tad off--the right three seem more tightly grouped than the left one. Finally, I think that it would be good if the red candle popped a little more--the rest of the image is very close to monochrome, so the one use of color should make more of a splash.', '2011-01-26 13:28:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(6294991, 931934, 119417, '<td valign="top">I like the concept, and the blues in the water are great. The focus is too soft for my taste, though, especially in the mud. The mud is also too dark to my eye--there''s enough detail there that it makes it a little frustrating that I can''t see more.</td>', 'I like the concept, and the blues in the water are great. The focus is too soft for my taste, though, especially in the mud. The mud is also too dark to my eye--there''s enough detail there that it makes it a little frustrating that I can''t see more.', '2011-01-26 13:29:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(6294995, 930979, 119417, '<td valign="top">Very nicely lit, though I do wish there could be a little more detail in the "earth" glass. Well-balanced composition. I particularly like the reflections in the tabletop, and the background has a very pleasing texture. I wonder how it would look if there was a little more light falloff toward the top of the background, leaving it darker behind the flame.</td>', 'Very nicely lit, though I do wish there could be a little more detail in the "earth" glass. Well-balanced composition. I particularly like the reflections in the tabletop, and the background has a very pleasing texture. I wonder how it would look if there was a little more light falloff toward the top of the background, leaving it darker behind the flame.', '2011-01-26 13:31:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(6294997, 931973, 119417, '<td valign="top">Good idea, but it''s a little too underexposed for my taste. I end up really wanting more detail in whatever the flame is coming out of. Hard to control the highlights, though, when you''re shooting directly at a flame like that.</td>', 'Good idea, but it''s a little too underexposed for my taste. I end up really wanting more detail in whatever the flame is coming out of. Hard to control the highlights, though, when you''re shooting directly at a flame like that.', '2011-01-26 13:32:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(6294999, 931430, 119417, '<td valign="top">Interesting use of hard light. Ideally, I''d like the water glass to be a little cleaner (there are some streaks around the rim), though the bubbles in it are a nice touch. I also think this would work better stopped down for deeper DOF.</td>', 'Interesting use of hard light. Ideally, I''d like the water glass to be a little cleaner (there are some streaks around the rim), though the bubbles in it are a nice touch. I also think this would work better stopped down for deeper DOF.', '2011-01-26 13:33:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(6295002, 931391, 86447, '<td valign="top">Had given this an 8... but bumping it up to a 9.   I love the pop of red on the black.</td>', 'Had given this an 8... but bumping it up to a 9.   I love the pop of red on the black.', '2011-01-26 13:34:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(6295003, 930959, 86447, '<td valign="top">I had given this an 8  (voted earlier)   but am bumping up to a 9.  You''ve done a great job w ith the lighting and composition..  all really well done.</td>', 'I had given this an 8  (voted earlier)   but am bumping up to a 9.  You''ve done a great job w ith the lighting and composition..  all really well done.', '2011-01-26 13:34:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(6295004, 931831, 86447, '<td valign="top">A 9 from me (voted earlier)   Welldone on all ''counts.  If there were a bit more to his eyes... this would have gotten a 10 from me.   Good stuff!</td>', 'A 9 from me (voted earlier)   Welldone on all ''counts.  If there were a bit more to his eyes... this would have gotten a 10 from me.   Good stuff!', '2011-01-26 13:35:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(6295005, 931979, 86447, '<td valign="top">Brilliant idea!   This gets a 9 from me (voted earlier) despite the bit of camera shake.</td>', 'Brilliant idea!   This gets a 9 from me (voted earlier) despite the bit of camera shake.', '2011-01-26 13:35:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(6295007, 931807, 119417, '<td valign="top">The texture in the wood is great. It''s very distracting, though, that the horizon isn''t level. Also, the way the roots are cut off on the right feels a little jarring. Maybe a more panoramic crop would look better, keeping the roots from being cut off on the right but also giving more open space on the left.</td>', 'The texture in the wood is great. It''s very distracting, though, that the horizon isn''t level. Also, the way the roots are cut off on the right feels a little jarring. Maybe a more panoramic crop would look better, keeping the roots from being cut off on the right but also giving more open space on the left.', '2011-01-26 13:35:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(6295008, 931967, 119417, '<td valign="top">I like the reflection of the sky in the pools at the lower right. But this is a little bit of a tough shot since it looks like the highlights are blown out around the sun, and then the rocks on the lower left are way underexposed. Possibly using a graduated ND filter would help here.</td>', 'I like the reflection of the sky in the pools at the lower right. But this is a little bit of a tough shot since it looks like the highlights are blown out around the sun, and then the rocks on the lower left are way underexposed. Possibly using a graduated ND filter would help here.', '2011-01-26 13:37:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(6295009, 931721, 119417, '<td valign="top">Wonderful composition. Not sure whether the big rock on the left side is perfect as it is or whether I''d want it to be lit a bit more. Still, great shot.</td>', 'Wonderful composition. Not sure whether the big rock on the left side is perfect as it is or whether I''d want it to be lit a bit more. Still, great shot.', '2011-01-26 13:38:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(6295010, 931513, 119417, '<td valign="top">This is an HDR shot, yes? I''m always a little ambivalent about HDR. It always feels gimmicky to me, but then you can get such wonderful colors and textures out of it, too. Anyway, the colors are spectacular, but I feel like all the trees and scrub in the foreground is distracting.</td>', 'This is an HDR shot, yes? I''m always a little ambivalent about HDR. It always feels gimmicky to me, but then you can get such wonderful colors and textures out of it, too. Anyway, the colors are spectacular, but I feel like all the trees and scrub in the foreground is distracting.', '2011-01-26 13:43:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(6295012, 931127, 119417, '<td valign="top">Lovely minimalist landscape. The only issue for me is that the horizon looks a little skewed to me.</td>', 'Lovely minimalist landscape. The only issue for me is that the horizon looks a little skewed to me.', '2011-01-26 13:44:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(6295014, 931390, 119417, '<td valign="top">Not sure I understand the title. Is this an HDR image? The sky is interesting, but also kind of unsettling. Compositionally, I think you''d do better to move the house out of the center of the frame. The reflections are nice, though.</td>', 'Not sure I understand the title. Is this an HDR image? The sky is interesting, but also kind of unsettling. Compositionally, I think you''d do better to move the house out of the center of the frame. The reflections are nice, though.', '2011-01-26 13:46:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(6295016, 931792, 119417, '<td valign="top">This might be a really good image, but it''s going over my head. Conceptual/abstract stuff done with extreme soft focus always does that for me.</td>', 'This might be a really good image, but it''s going over my head. Conceptual/abstract stuff done with extreme soft focus always does that for me.', '2011-01-26 13:47:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(6295018, 931923, 119417, '<td valign="top">The main thing for me here is that the flame is being repeated in all of the other glasses. That might be intentional, but it doesn''t work well for me. I''m also not sure about the choice of a completely black background, especially since it looks like you may have simply cut out the background in post.</td>', 'The main thing for me here is that the flame is being repeated in all of the other glasses. That might be intentional, but it doesn''t work well for me. I''m also not sure about the choice of a completely black background, especially since it looks like you may have simply cut out the background in post.', '2011-01-26 13:49:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(6295021, 930861, 119417, '<td valign="top">Not bad, but I think you might do a little better to place the causeway (or whatever it is) lower in the frame. Also, the horizon is a little skewed.</td>', 'Not bad, but I think you might do a little better to place the causeway (or whatever it is) lower in the frame. Also, the horizon is a little skewed.', '2011-01-26 13:50:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(6295022, 931932, 6565, '<td valign="top">I didn''t get this at first, and thought you''d completely missed the challenge. I''m SO glad you left the dirt on the potatoes, because it made me look again, think again, and go AHHH! This is one of my favorite images of the challenge. Very clever!</td>', 'I didn''t get this at first, and thought you''d completely missed the challenge. I''m SO glad you left the dirt on the potatoes, because it made me look again, think again, and go AHHH! This is one of my favorite images of the challenge. Very clever!', '2011-01-26 13:51:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(6295023, 931391, 119417, '<td valign="top">Wonderful soft lighting. Love the composition. Nothing distracts. Very, very good.</td>', 'Wonderful soft lighting. Love the composition. Nothing distracts. Very, very good.', '2011-01-26 13:51:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(6295025, 930969, 119417, '<td valign="top">Great interpretation of the theme. The steam rising off the snow looking like smoke is just amazing.</td>', 'Great interpretation of the theme. The steam rising off the snow looking like smoke is just amazing.', '2011-01-26 13:52:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(6295027, 930952, 119417, '<td valign="top">Not a bad idea, but there are several elements here that could work better. First, the composition feels quite crowded, especially with the top of the stick cut off. Since you''ve placed the flag and stick so close, they dominate the image, but instead of feeling big or important, it just feels close. Try taking a lower angle, so that the flag feels more imposing (and also so it doesn''t intersect the horizon).<br/> <br/>Also, the exposure is kind of flat. I would have taken it up maybe a third to two-thirds of a stop and then adjusted the contrast in post. Alternatively (or maybe additionally) you can try shooting later (or much earlier) in the day to get the really great lighting.<br/> <br/>Finally, the horizon isn''t level. It''s a minor thing, but it makes a difference.</td>', 'Not a bad idea, but there are several elements here that could work better. First, the composition feels quite crowded, especially with the top of the stick cut off. Since you''ve placed the flag and stick so close, they dominate the image, but instead of feeling big or important, it just feels close. Try taking a lower angle, so that the flag feels more imposing (and also so it doesn''t intersect the horizon). Also, the exposure is kind of flat. I would have taken it up maybe a third to two-thirds of a stop and then adjusted the contrast in post. Alternatively (or maybe additionally) you can try shooting later (or much earlier) in the day to get the really great lighting. Finally, the horizon isn''t level. It''s a minor thing, but it makes a difference.', '2011-01-26 13:56:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(6295030, 931919, 119417, '<td valign="top">Not sure this really matches the theme, though the title did make me grin. The blurry thing in the foreground (trash can, maybe?) is pretty distracting, and the bright spot in the snow (lens flare?) could also go. I think the focus is a little off, and, personally, I prefer an image like this to be higher contrast.<br/> <br/>On the other hand, I like the scene and the line of the fence. I like that you can see the bridge in the background. Maybe one step to the right to get the bridge framed by the tree branches a bit better.</td>', 'Not sure this really matches the theme, though the title did make me grin. The blurry thing in the foreground (trash can, maybe?) is pretty distracting, and the bright spot in the snow (lens flare?) could also go. I think the focus is a little off, and, personally, I prefer an image like this to be higher contrast. On the other hand, I like the scene and the line of the fence. I like that you can see the bridge in the background. Maybe one step to the right to get the bridge framed by the tree branches a bit better.', '2011-01-26 13:58:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(6295031, 931887, 119417, '<td valign="top">Very nice slow shutter work. I particularly like the texture of the rocks and the person perfectly framed by the circle of light.</td>', 'Very nice slow shutter work. I particularly like the texture of the rocks and the person perfectly framed by the circle of light.', '2011-01-26 14:01:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(6295033, 931932, 119417, '<td valign="top">Very nice interpretation of the theme. The light seems a little stark to me, though.</td>', 'Very nice interpretation of the theme. The light seems a little stark to me, though.', '2011-01-26 14:02:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(6295034, 931389, 119417, '<td valign="top">Great texture in the water, rock, and sand. Very nice color in the sky. Is this done completely with natural light? If so, I think it could be improved with a bit of strobism to highlight the woman a bit more--maybe even just one light from camera left. Still, very nice.</td>', 'Great texture in the water, rock, and sand. Very nice color in the sky. Is this done completely with natural light? If so, I think it could be improved with a bit of strobism to highlight the woman a bit more--maybe even just one light from camera left. Still, very nice.', '2011-01-26 14:03:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(6295036, 931440, 119417, '<td valign="top">I like the halo and the snow. Only thing is that my eye doesn''t seem to find a natural resting place. I don''t know what to offer as an improvement, though.</td>', 'I like the halo and the snow. Only thing is that my eye doesn''t seem to find a natural resting place. I don''t know what to offer as an improvement, though.', '2011-01-26 14:04:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(6295038, 931986, 119417, '<td valign="top">I love the paper. It''s always nice when a good DIY idea comes together. Only thing for me is that the highlights in the glasses are a little harsh.</td>', 'I love the paper. It''s always nice when a good DIY idea comes together. Only thing for me is that the highlights in the glasses are a little harsh.', '2011-01-26 14:05:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(6295040, 931958, 119417, '<td valign="top">Oh, lovely. Very subtle use of the four elements. I just love the details--the fingernail, the wax, the snow. Great use of DOF, as well.</td>', 'Oh, lovely. Very subtle use of the four elements. I just love the details--the fingernail, the wax, the snow. Great use of DOF, as well.', '2011-01-26 14:06:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(6295041, 931165, 119417, '<td valign="top">I have next to no idea what I''m seeing here, except that I assume it''s a long-exposure shot. But the textures and composition are very well done.</td>', 'I have next to no idea what I''m seeing here, except that I assume it''s a long-exposure shot. But the textures and composition are very well done.', '2011-01-26 14:07:50.000000', NULL, 1),
