(6299064, 931979, 85430, '<td valign="top">I like how you set this up. Very diffent from all the other entries. The color emphasis added a lot to the composition.  There are actually several small items in this shot, but they do not attract attention to themselves. The image is viewed as a whole, and a very pleasant one it is. bumped to 8</td>', 'I like how you set this up. Very diffent from all the other entries. The color emphasis added a lot to the composition.  There are actually several small items in this shot, but they do not attract attention to themselves. The image is viewed as a whole, and a very pleasant one it is. bumped to 8', '2011-01-31 21:21:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(6299070, 931389, 85430, '<td valign="top">excellent detail. i like the composition. i appreciate the amount of effort given for this shot. and it was well worth it to have come up with this beautiful image. the warm sunset/sunrise shares the frame with the cool splashes of waves. the model''s costume speaks well of the basic materials we derive from the earth. i can almost feel the cool breeze of air as it touches the skin. simply beautiful. all four elements combined in harmony for this wonderful shot. 10</td>', 'excellent detail. i like the composition. i appreciate the amount of effort given for this shot. and it was well worth it to have come up with this beautiful image. the warm sunset/sunrise shares the frame with the cool splashes of waves. the model''s costume speaks well of the basic materials we derive from the earth. i can almost feel the cool breeze of air as it touches the skin. simply beautiful. all four elements combined in harmony for this wonderful shot. 10', '2011-01-31 21:34:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(6299079, 931923, 85430, '<td valign="top">I tried it myself. i came up with reflections all over the glass. so how do you come up with wonderful lighting? i''d like to ask for your light setup in your photographer''s notes. 6 btw.</td>', 'I tried it myself. i came up with reflections all over the glass. so how do you come up with wonderful lighting? i''d like to ask for your light setup in your photographer''s notes. 6 btw.', '2011-01-31 21:42:21.000000', NULL, 1),
