(6299099, 931986, 85430, '<td valign="top">Interesting composition. I wish the glasses were cleaner. The tiny reflections are distracting. The earth did not have to be a literal globe as everything in this shot, from the wax and wick of the candle to the rubber, paper and glass, are all earth''s produce. I also wish the the glasses were not cut off at the base. Concept and execution were very good, but overall it lacks a wow factor, probably because of the dull color combination you have selected.<br/> <br/>eta: after a final round of viewing the entries, i think this should be up among my 6s.</td>', 'Interesting composition. I wish the glasses were cleaner. The tiny reflections are distracting. The earth did not have to be a literal globe as everything in this shot, from the wax and wick of the candle to the rubber, paper and glass, are all earth''s produce. I also wish the the glasses were not cut off at the base. Concept and execution were very good, but overall it lacks a wow factor, probably because of the dull color combination you have selected. eta: after a final round of viewing the entries, i think this should be up among my 6s.', '2011-01-31 21:49:07.000000', NULL, 1),
