(6300290, 931967, 127046, '<td valign="top">Nice work, could definitely benefit from a reverse grad filter. Did you use a ND grad? Good depth, but maybe a lower perspective would be nicer.</td>', 'Nice work, could definitely benefit from a reverse grad filter. Did you use a ND grad? Good depth, but maybe a lower perspective would be nicer.', '2011-02-01 22:12:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(6300292, 931389, 127046, '<td valign="top">Nice job. I think the water wash on the beach is a bit distracting. That''s a tough one to solve because it is a direct reflection of the sun. I might have brought up the light on the model a bit more, and put a snoot on a flash toward the face to mimic the candle light.</td>', 'Nice job. I think the water wash on the beach is a bit distracting. That''s a tough one to solve because it is a direct reflection of the sun. I might have brought up the light on the model a bit more, and put a snoot on a flash toward the face to mimic the candle light.', '2011-02-01 22:16:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(6300297, 931940, 127046, '<td valign="top">Did you use a tripod? It looks like there might have been a bit of camera shake.</td>', 'Did you use a tripod? It looks like there might have been a bit of camera shake.', '2011-02-01 22:17:47.000000', NULL, 1),
