(6300515, 931887, 40718, '<td valign="top">Well, I''ve seen like three pictures of this in the last week and I have to say I''m all in.  I gots to try me this!</td>', 'Well, I''ve seen like three pictures of this in the last week and I have to say I''m all in.  I gots to try me this!', '2011-02-02 00:42:52.000000', NULL, 0),
(6300534, 931792, 50864, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by daisydavid:</b></div><hr/><i> Ok I gave you an 8, no one knows what it is but we who commented on the whole like it, so what is it ;)  ? (please) </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>This is a picture of the sand dunes in Death Valley with the pinhole.  There is a person moving in the front. I do get some strange things with the pinhole and it sure is fun.  I probably wouldn''t have used this shot for anything but I saw the "rain" in the left upper corner and the "fire" in the right upper and figured it should work.  I found the term "Moon Wobble" on line. Used by astrologists to describe a period when the earth is in upheaval (fire/floods/earthquakes/etc) due to, well, the moon wobbling. Thanks for your interest.</td>', 'Originally posted by daisydavid: Ok I gave you an 8, no one knows what it is but we who commented on the whole like it, so what is it ;)  ? (please)   This is a picture of the sand dunes in Death Valley with the pinhole.  There is a person moving in the front. I do get some strange things with the pinhole and it sure is fun.  I probably wouldn''t have used this shot for anything but I saw the "rain" in the left upper corner and the "fire" in the right upper and figured it should work.  I found the term "Moon Wobble" on line. Used by astrologists to describe a period when the earth is in upheaval (fire/floods/earthquakes/etc) due to, well, the moon wobbling. Thanks for your interest.', '2011-02-02 00:55:07.000000', NULL, 0),
(6300542, 931389, 54645, '<td valign="top">Congrats Lev. Chilly in San Diego...I lived there...65 is rough!</td>', 'Congrats Lev. Chilly in San Diego...I lived there...65 is rough!', '2011-02-02 01:01:17.000000', NULL, 0),
(6300546, 930959, 93565, '<td valign="top">Ha, I was pretty sure I was correct in guessing you. I didn''t notice the graduated border the first time- it''s a nice touch. Congrats on the placement, as well.</td>', 'Ha, I was pretty sure I was correct in guessing you. I didn''t notice the graduated border the first time- it''s a nice touch. Congrats on the placement, as well.', '2011-02-02 01:03:02.000000', NULL, 0),
(6300554, 931923, 125134, '<td valign="top">Thanks for the comments! It''s really helpful to hear people''s opinions. I''m only just starting to learn about photography - only got my camera in December, so the lighting worked out quite lucky without much of a setup. I set the glasses up in my husband''s open guitar case to use as a black background. I drew the study curtains closed and closed some doors that were adding in too much light. Took a number of shots to see how light or dark it was, and increased my ISO to 400 to allow for a brighter picture. Made a few adjustments in PS and this was the result. Must say, I''m very happy with my best score so far! :-) Looking forward to learning lots more!</td>', 'Thanks for the comments! It''s really helpful to hear people''s opinions. I''m only just starting to learn about photography - only got my camera in December, so the lighting worked out quite lucky without much of a setup. I set the glasses up in my husband''s open guitar case to use as a black background. I drew the study curtains closed and closed some doors that were adding in too much light. Took a number of shots to see how light or dark it was, and increased my ISO to 400 to allow for a brighter picture. Made a few adjustments in PS and this was the result. Must say, I''m very happy with my best score so far! :-) Looking forward to learning lots more!', '2011-02-02 01:06:02.000000', NULL, 0),
(6300587, 930959, 86447, '<td valign="top">FABULOUS!!   I really am thrilled this made the front page!</td>', 'FABULOUS!!   I really am thrilled this made the front page!', '2011-02-02 01:17:49.000000', NULL, 0),
(6300590, 931831, 86447, '<td valign="top">Oh!  CONGRATS on your RIBBON!!   Loving this... still!</td>', 'Oh!  CONGRATS on your RIBBON!!   Loving this... still!', '2011-02-02 01:18:54.000000', NULL, 0);
