(6301704, 931932, 103142, '<td valign="top">A group of us from Team Suck are reviving the OOBIE awards, and you''re our second award winner!  Here''s more info if you need it:  <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/forum.php?action=read&amp;FORUM_THREAD_ID=396167&amp;highlight=oobies" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">TS Oobie</a>.  Congrats!<br/> <br/>When I first looked at this one, I couldn''t figure out what in the world you were thinking! But on second glance, I realized just how clever it was, and the committee agreed. Nice way to fit the challenge and be out of the box at the same time. Clever and beautifully done! <br/> <br/>Have an OOBie. :)<br/> <br/><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/70000-74999/70828/120/503169.gif'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/70000-74999/70828/120/503169.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/70000-74999/70828/120/503169.gif"/></td>', 'A group of us from Team Suck are reviving the OOBIE awards, and you''re our second award winner!  Here''s more info if you need it:  TS Oobie.  Congrats! When I first looked at this one, I couldn''t figure out what in the world you were thinking! But on second glance, I realized just how clever it was, and the committee agreed. Nice way to fit the challenge and be out of the box at the same time. Clever and beautifully done!  Have an OOBie. :) ', '2011-02-02 23:19:22.000000', NULL, 0),
