(6301929, 931213, 28359, '<td valign="top">This is a interesting take on the challenge. I think <img alt="'' . substr(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_N.gif'', strrpos(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_N.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_N.gif"/> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/profile.php?USER_ID=96751" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">tanguera</a> nailed the processing that you needed to help. The white balance is the biggest issue....Creative!</td>', 'This is a interesting take on the challenge. I think  tanguera nailed the processing that you needed to help. The white balance is the biggest issue....Creative!', '2011-02-03 09:43:26.000000', NULL, 0),
