(6302394, 931792, 11769, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by 2mccs:</b></div><hr/><i> <table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by daisydavid:</b></div><hr/><i> Ok I gave you an 8, no one knows what it is but we who commented on the whole like it, so what is it ;)  ? (please) </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>This is a picture of the sand dunes in Death Valley with the pinhole.  There is a person moving in the front. I do get some strange things with the pinhole and it sure is fun.  I probably wouldn''t have used this shot for anything but I saw the "rain" in the left upper corner and the "fire" in the right upper and figured it should work.  I found the term "Moon Wobble" on line. Used by astrologists to describe a period when the earth is in upheaval (fire/floods/earthquakes/etc) due to, well, the moon wobbling. Thanks for your interest. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Never heard of the Moon wobbling before.</td>', 'Originally posted by 2mccs: Originally posted by daisydavid: Ok I gave you an 8, no one knows what it is but we who commented on the whole like it, so what is it ;)  ? (please)   This is a picture of the sand dunes in Death Valley with the pinhole.  There is a person moving in the front. I do get some strange things with the pinhole and it sure is fun.  I probably wouldn''t have used this shot for anything but I saw the "rain" in the left upper corner and the "fire" in the right upper and figured it should work.  I found the term "Moon Wobble" on line. Used by astrologists to describe a period when the earth is in upheaval (fire/floods/earthquakes/etc) due to, well, the moon wobbling. Thanks for your interest.   Never heard of the Moon wobbling before.', '2011-02-03 21:10:40.000000', NULL, 0),
(6302464, 931389, 69668, '<td valign="top">Congrats Lev....you are on a roll.  I need to say congrats over and over to you to catch up on all your wins!!!</td>', 'Congrats Lev....you are on a roll.  I need to say congrats over and over to you to catch up on all your wins!!!', '2011-02-03 23:30:22.000000', NULL, 0),
(6302742, 931389, 29011, '<td valign="top">Congratulations on the blue! :)<br/>Very much deserved. I wouldn''t worry about the sandals too much. I agree with one poster who said they could pass for older looking sandal types. Look at the Esparto sandals here <a href="//en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Sandal" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">//en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Sandal</a> . With some minor cloning touchups you can really make those fit in.<br/> <br/>eta: Congrats on the 1x post as well.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2011-02-04 13:10:49.</i></td>', 'Congratulations on the blue! :)Very much deserved. I wouldn''t worry about the sandals too much. I agree with one poster who said they could pass for older looking sandal types. Look at the Esparto sandals here //en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Sandal . With some minor cloning touchups you can really make those fit in. eta: Congrats on the 1x post as well.', '2011-02-04 12:12:04.000000', '2011-02-04 13:10:49.000000', 0),
